      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i been having really bad leg cramps at night and it's making it impossible to sleep. i heard magnesium helps a lot with that? i saw some magnesium citrate pills online that say 500mg... is that a good amount to take every night or should i go higher to really feel it? also just so u know i do have some mild kidney issues so i have to be careful with stuff.",
