      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the info. my doctor is actually super busy and it takes like 2 weeks to even get a call back with him so i dont want to wait that long if i'm suffering now lol. like, if my kidney stuff is just \"mild\" is it really that big of a deal for a supplement? like would taking 1000mg once in a while if the cramps are really bad be totally fine? i just want to get some sleep tonight.",
